<title>NEW ZEALAND: Capital Group holds 5.94 pct of CIL.</title>
<headline>Capital Group holds 5.94 pct of CIL.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand investment company Corporate Investments Ltd said on Friday the Capital Group of companies had bought a 5.94 percent stake in the company.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, CIL announced that chairman Peter Masfen's</p>
<p>family interests had sold 24 million CIL shares to an overseas</p>
<p>institution.</p>
<p>The Capital Group is a fund manager.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
